) and H1 bar 116 (open 2617.83, low 2571, close 2573.13) closed near their lows well below the H1/H4 7-bar range low 2604.75, so the 12-bar M15 range is at least as easily read as a bear flag, and the first reversal attempt after such a spike often fails with a second leg down.", "The range's highs keep falling: 2594.57 (bars 108/109), 2587.03 (110), 2586.73 (112), 2585.39 (113), 2583.44 (116/117), 2580.56 (118), 2577.99 (119) - the 2577.99 trigger must clear three lower highs before the 2594.57 top is even tested.", "H1 bar 119 (open 2578.56, low 2573.82, close 2577.06) closed below H1 bar 118's low 2578.33, so the newest H1 close is bearish and under the prior bar's low; the H4 context's last close 2586.68 predates these two H1 closes.", "H4 context flags a buy climax: bar 116's 2700.00 exceeded 2680.00 by only 20.00 and closed 61.51 below its high, and its final bar closed under the 7-bar range low 2604.75 and under the lows of bars 113-119; this long is the first pullback of a possibly unconfirmed MTR, with 2537.57-2544.63 as deeper support.", "The entry is not the range's extreme low (2569.8) and no bull breakout above 2594.57 has occurred, so the stop can be filled while the 12-bar range is still undecided."], "qualitative_confidence": "low", "uncertainty": ["The 12-bar M15 range 2569.8-2594.57 has not resolved; a break below 2569.8 (bear flag) and a break above 2594.57 (bull flag) are both live.", "The buy stop at 2577.99 is pending and untriggered at the 2577.06 close; if price closes below 2569.8 first the setup is void.", "The H4 context's content ends at the H1 bar 117 close 2586.68 (as-of 1789876799999) and excludes H1 bars 118-119 (closes 2580.35, 2577.06), so its bullish 'final close above 2585.50' point is older than the raw bars.", "The 2700.00 buy climax with a 61.51 upper tail raises the chance the pullback extends toward 2537.57-2544.63 before any resumption, which would invalidate this entry even if the larger trend stays up."], "conditions_that_